{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Donut Dodo FANTASTICO",
    "steam_appid": 3792070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792070/extras/33308dc0066058188de495918b43e3d8.avif?t=1755251602\" width=758 height=267 /></span><strong>FANTASTICO </strong>is the long-awaited sequel to the 1983-style smash arcade hit <strong>Donut Dodo</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goofy bird returns to treat <strong>Dodo Junior</strong> to a whirlwind day at the vintage funfair - a delightful outing packed with spinning rides, wild attractions, and enough donuts to hit the sweet spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait! <strong>Baker Billy Burns</strong> is here to make a mess of things and grab every last donut before little Junior can get those wings sticky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donut Dodo FANTASTICO </strong>is a <strong>single-screen arcade platformer</strong> inspired by the golden age of gaming. You\u2019ll run, climb, jump, and scramble through colorful stages - dodging enemies, bouncing through hazards, and snatching up donuts before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is a quick, skill-based challenge designed for <strong>short and sweet play sessions</strong>\u00a0- whether you\u2019ve got 3 minutes or 30, there\u2019s always time for \u201cjust one more run.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792070/extras/d6d84e9c8e2ca070f3682f15bc0ba699.avif?t=1755251602\" width=480 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re going back to 1983, <strong>again</strong>, with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique funfair-themed stages and all-new attraction-based mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and share the fun! Local couch-coop mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, precise controls tailored for pure arcade action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple secrets and alternate endings based on skill and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and global high-score leaderboards, arcade-style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glorious CRT-friendly pixel art with a vibrant 16-color palette</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic high energy chiptune soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No continues - each run is a fresh chance to climb the leaderboard! <br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Oh, and yes\u2026 <strong>Stinky the rogue toilet is back!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792070/extras/33308dc0066058188de495918b43e3d8.avif?t=1755251602\" width=758 height=267 /></span><strong>FANTASTICO </strong>is the long-awaited sequel to the 1983-style smash arcade hit <strong>Donut Dodo</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goofy bird returns to treat <strong>Dodo Junior</strong> to a whirlwind day at the vintage funfair - a delightful outing packed with spinning rides, wild attractions, and enough donuts to hit the sweet spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait! <strong>Baker Billy Burns</strong> is here to make a mess of things and grab every last donut before little Junior can get those wings sticky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donut Dodo FANTASTICO </strong>is a <strong>single-screen arcade platformer</strong> inspired by the golden age of gaming. You\u2019ll run, climb, jump, and scramble through colorful stages - dodging enemies, bouncing through hazards, and snatching up donuts before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is a quick, skill-based challenge designed for <strong>short and sweet play sessions</strong>\u00a0- whether you\u2019ve got 3 minutes or 30, there\u2019s always time for \u201cjust one more run.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792070/extras/d6d84e9c8e2ca070f3682f15bc0ba699.avif?t=1755251602\" width=480 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re going back to 1983, <strong>again</strong>, with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique funfair-themed stages and all-new attraction-based mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and share the fun! Local couch-coop mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, precise controls tailored for pure arcade action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple secrets and alternate endings based on skill and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and global high-score leaderboards, arcade-style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glorious CRT-friendly pixel art with a vibrant 16-color palette</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic high energy chiptune soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No continues - each run is a fresh chance to climb the leaderboard! <br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Oh, and yes\u2026 <strong>Stinky the rogue toilet is back!</strong></p>",
